{"seq":3,"slug":"accumulation-de-minimis-tolerance","title":"累积规则与微小含量容忍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-criteria/accumulation-de-minimis-tolerance","wordCount":1804,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"累积规则与微小含量容忍\">累积规则与微小含量容忍</h1><p>一份在马来西亚完成的电路板，非原产材料占比 62%，按基本规则过不了 RVC 40%。但其中一部分元件来自中国和日本——如果这批货的目的地是另一个 RCEP 成员国，那部分元件就能算作「区域原产」，占比一下降到 31%，享惠成立。累积规则与微小含量容忍是两条把「差一点」的判定拉回合格的宽容条款，也是核查时最容易被翻出来重新计算的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>判定标准是硬的，但协定同时留了两条软化路径，让区域内的供应链能真正被当作一个整体：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[判定不满足基本规则] --&gt; B{有哪些宽容条款}&#10;  B --&gt; C[累积规则]&#10;  B --&gt; D[微小含量容忍]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[双边累积 两国互认]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[对角累积 指定第三国]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[完全累积 连加工也累]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[按价值百分比]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[按重量百分比]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[仅限未满足 CTC 的材料]\">graph TD\n  A[判定不满足基本规则] --&gt; B{有哪些宽容条款}\n  B --&gt; C[累积规则]\n  B --&gt; D[微小含量容忍]\n  C --&gt; C1[双边累积 两国互认]\n  C --&gt; C2[对角累积 指定第三国]\n  C --&gt; C3[完全累积 连加工也累]\n  D --&gt; D1[按价值百分比]\n  D --&gt; D2[按重量百分比]\n  D --&gt; D3[仅限未满足 CTC 的材料]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条款</th>\n<th>作用方式</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>典型阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双边累积</td>\n<td>对方原产材料视为本方原产</td>\n<td>两国间有协定</td>\n<td>无阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对角累积</td>\n<td>指定第三国材料也计入</td>\n<td>协定明文授权 + 规则相同</td>\n<td>无阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全累积</td>\n<td>加工过程也跨境累计</td>\n<td>协定明文授权</td>\n<td>无阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微小含量（价值）</td>\n<td>未满足 CTC 的材料可忽略</td>\n<td>仅 CTC 类规则</td>\n<td>通常 10%–15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微小含量（重量）</td>\n<td>纺织品的重量容忍</td>\n<td>纺织类章</td>\n<td>通常 10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条条款的数学效果相同——都是把分子或分母改一改让判定通过——但法律后果完全不同。累积改变的是「什么算原产材料」，微小含量改变的是「多大的违规可以被忽略」。前者是全量重算，后者是局部豁免。</p>\n<h2 id=\"累积的三种形态\">累积的三种形态</h2><h3 id=\"双边累积\">双边累积</h3><p>两个缔约国之间互认。欧盟与任一伙伴国的协定都包含双边累积：欧盟原产材料在伙伴国被视为伙伴国原产，反之亦然（<a href=\"https://trade.ec.europa.eu/access-to-markets/en/content/cumulation-0\">EU Access2Markets: Cumulation</a>）。这是最弱也最普遍的形态，几乎不需要额外条件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对角累积及其前置条件\">对角累积及其前置条件</h3><p>对角累积涉及三个以上国家：来自某个<strong>明确指定</strong>国家的材料可计入原产，但只在协定有明文授权时成立。关键前置条件是「累积只能在规则相同的国家之间适用」——两侧的原产规则必须一致，否则同一种加工在两国得到不同判定，累积就失去意义。</p>\n<p>对角累积有两个常见变体：普惠制下的<strong>区域累积</strong>（同一区域集团内互相累积）和<strong>扩展累积</strong>（把特定国家的材料纳入）。两者都必须有明文授权，不能默认适用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"完全累积的差别\">完全累积的差别</h3><p>完全累积比对角累积更进一步：它不只累加原产材料，还把在伙伴国对<strong>非原产材料</strong>做的加工也算进来。也就是说，A 国用进口原料做了一半加工，B 国接着做完，判定时把两段加工合起来看是否达标。限制是：如果某国所做的加工只是「不足加工清单」里的操作，完全累积不适用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"累积的递归实现\">累积的递归实现</h3><p>累积在代码上表现为一次带区域标记的 BOM 递归：遇到非原产材料时，检查其原产国是否属于当前协定的累积圈，是则按原产材料回填。这里必须防止递归环（A 的材料来自 B，B 的材料又回到 A），并记录每次回填的依据，供核查时追溯。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 材料原产归属表：记录每层材料在特定协定下的有效归属&#10;CREATE TABLE material_origin_attribution (&#10;  agreement        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  material_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  supplier_country TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  declared_origin  TEXT NOT NULL,   -- 供应商申报的原产国&#10;  effective_origin TEXT NOT NULL,   -- 应用累积后的有效原产国&#10;  basis            TEXT NOT NULL,   -- &#39;BILATERAL&#39;|&#39;DIAGONAL&#39;|&#39;FULL&#39;|&#39;NONE&#39;&#10;  evidence_ref     TEXT,            -- 供应商声明/证书编号&#10;  computed_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (agreement, material_id, computed_at)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 材料原产归属表：记录每层材料在特定协定下的有效归属</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> material_origin_attribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agreement        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  material_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_origin  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 供应商申报的原产国</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_origin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 应用累积后的有效原产国</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'BILATERAL'|'DIAGONAL'|'FULL'|'NONE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 供应商声明/证书编号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (agreement, material_id, computed_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"累积的常见误用\">累积的常见误用</h3><p>最常见错误是把没有累积授权的国家材料也算进来。RCEP 内部可以累积，不代表 RCEP 材料在中欧双边协定下自动算原产——累积是<strong>逐协定授权</strong>的，跨协定套用会直接导致享惠主张无效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微小含量容忍\">微小含量容忍</h2><h3 id=\"价值型与重量型\">价值型与重量型</h3><p>微小含量允许少量未满足规则的非原产材料被忽略。欧盟体系的通行阈值是「通常 10% 或 15%」，纺织与纺织制品（HS 第 50 至 63 章）另有专门规则（<a href=\"https://trade.ec.europa.eu/access-to-markets/en/content/tolerance-or-de-minimis\">EU Access2Markets: Tolerance / de minimis</a>）。计算基数有两个选项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>容忍率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>或</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>product</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{容忍率} = \\frac{V_{NOM}}{EXW} \\times 100 \\quad \\text{或} \\quad \\frac{W_{NOM}}{W_{\\text{product}}} \\times 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">容忍率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">product</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>价值型以成品的出厂价为基数，重量型以成品重量为基数。选哪一种由协定规定，不能由企业自选。纺织类用重量型是因为其价值波动大而重量稳定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"只对-ctc-生效\">只对 CTC 生效</h3><p>微小含量只适用于未满足<strong>归类改变</strong>要求的非原产材料，不能用来突破 RVC 阈值或特定工序要求。USMCA 的表述是：未满足所需税则改变的非原产材料，其价值不超过成交价或总成本的 10% 时可被忽略，但这些材料仍要计入任何 RVC 计算（<a href=\"https://www.international.gc.ca/trade-commerce/trade-agreements-accords-commerciaux/agr-acc/cusma-aceum/text-texte/04.aspx\">CUSMA/USMCA Chapter 4</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不能放宽既有百分比\">不能放宽既有百分比</h3><p>一个反直觉的限制：容忍规则<strong>不能</strong>放宽产品特定规则中已经存在的百分比上限。如果某条规则写「非原产材料不超过 20%」，那么容忍不能把它变成 30%；容忍只在规则本身没给百分比、而材料卡在 CTC 上时起作用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排除清单\">排除清单</h3><p>多数协定附有 de minimis 例外清单，主要覆盖农产品与 HS 第 1 至 27 章中同子目的货物。这些品类不适用容忍，即使价值极低也不行。引擎必须在规则表里为这些 HS 前缀打上 <code>de_minimis_allowed = false</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条条款的叠加顺序\">两条条款的叠加顺序</h2><h3 id=\"计算顺序影响结论\">计算顺序影响结论</h3><p>先累积还是先容忍，可能得到不同结论。标准做法是<strong>先累积、后容忍</strong>：先把可累积的材料补全为原产，剩下的真非原产材料再看是否落在容忍范围内。反过来的顺序会先把本可通过累积变成原产的材料当作违规消耗掉容忍额度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边界案例\">边界案例</h3><p>设想非原产材料占 14%，其中 6% 来自累积圈内。先累积后容忍：累积后非原产降至 8%，即便不及任何容忍门槛也已通过或接近通过。先容忍后累积：14% 可能已超 10% 容忍而被判失败。这不是数值游戏——协定文本规定的就是前者，引擎必须按文本顺序实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;evaluation_order&quot;: [&quot;ACCUMULATION&quot;, &quot;DE_MINIMIS&quot;],&#10;  &quot;accumulation_scope&quot;: { &quot;agreement&quot;: &quot;RCEP&quot;, &quot;members&quot;: [&quot;CN&quot;, &quot;JP&quot;, &quot;KR&quot;, &quot;VN&quot;, &quot;MY&quot;] },&#10;  &quot;de_minimis&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;applies_to&quot;: [&quot;CTC&quot;],&#10;    &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;VALUE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;threshold_pct&quot;: 10.0,&#10;    &quot;excluded_hs_prefixes&quot;: [&quot;01&quot;, &quot;02&quot;, &quot;10&quot;, &quot;22&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evaluation_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACCUMULATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE_MINIMIS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"accumulation_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"agreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"members\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"de_minimis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CTC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VALUE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"threshold_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"excluded_hs_prefixes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"22\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>累积让区域内材料互认，微小含量让少量违规可忽略，两者数学效果相似但法律后果不同。</li>\n<li>累积分双边、对角、完全三种，且<strong>逐协定授权</strong>；对角与完全累积需明文条款。</li>\n<li>累积前置条件是双方规则相同，跨协定套用累积是最常见的误用。</li>\n<li>微小含量只对 CTC 生效，可用价值或重量为基数，且不能放宽既有百分比上限。</li>\n<li>农产品与第 1–27 章部分品类被排除在容忍之外，规则表须显式标记。</li>\n<li>计算顺序必须是先累积后容忍，否则会把可累积材料浪费在容忍额度上。</li>\n<li>本章的判定标准与宽容条款是第二章引擎的规则库内容，见 <a href=\"../origin-determination-data/origin-qualification-engine\">原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"累积规则与微小含量容忍","id":"累积规则与微小含量容忍"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"累积的三种形态","id":"累积的三种形态"},{"level":3,"text":"双边累积","id":"双边累积"},{"level":3,"text":"对角累积及其前置条件","id":"对角累积及其前置条件"},{"level":3,"text":"完全累积的差别","id":"完全累积的差别"},{"level":3,"text":"累积的递归实现","id":"累积的递归实现"},{"level":3,"text":"累积的常见误用","id":"累积的常见误用"},{"level":2,"text":"微小含量容忍","id":"微小含量容忍"},{"level":3,"text":"价值型与重量型","id":"价值型与重量型"},{"level":3,"text":"只对 CTC 生效","id":"只对-ctc-生效"},{"level":3,"text":"不能放宽既有百分比","id":"不能放宽既有百分比"},{"level":3,"text":"排除清单","id":"排除清单"},{"level":2,"text":"两条条款的叠加顺序","id":"两条条款的叠加顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"计算顺序影响结论","id":"计算顺序影响结论"},{"level":3,"text":"边界案例","id":"边界案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WO/WP(归类改变)/RVC(价值成分)/加工工序标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-criteria/wo-wp-rvc-processing-rule"},"next":{"title":"底层 BOM 与供应商原料原产数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-determination-data/bom-supplier-origin-data"}}